          </a>
          <p class="mt-2 text-center text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-950">
            Kemasan Coba 250ml (Rp 75.000 = 125 Liter) & Paket Nursery 500ml (Rp 135.000) — Bisa COD!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. VISUAL PROBLEM SECTION (Luka Kolektor & Nursery Tanaman Hias) -->
    <section class="bg-red-50/40 px-5 py-7">
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <span class="inline-block rounded bg-red-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-red-800">
          KENAPA HARGA JUAL & KEINDAHAN KOLEKSI ANJLOK 70%?
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-[24px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950">
          2 Kerugian Fatal <span class="hl-brush-red">Penangkar & Kolektor Hias</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] w-full bg-slate-900">
            <img
              src="/images/landing/serum-tanaman-hias-anggrek-aglonema-saratoga/gejala-1.webp"
              alt="Rak anggrek mogok berbunga cuma tumbuh daun kusam kuncup menguning gugur dan daun aglonema berkerak putih kapur"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              width="960"
              height="536"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/95 via-slate-950/60 to-transparent p-3">
