            Tanpa L-Amino pembunga & Boron-GA3 seimbang, mata spike tertidur permanen dan daun Aglonema mengecil pucat.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] w-full bg-slate-900">
            <img
              src="/images/landing/serum-tanaman-hias-anggrek-aglonema-saratoga/gejala-2.webp"
              alt="Pupuk organik cair bau amis di teras rumah mengundang semut lalat media serta bercak kapur putih merusak kilap daun"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              width="960"
              height="536"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/95 via-slate-950/60 to-transparent p-3">
              <span class="inline-block rounded bg-red-600 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-white">
                MASALAH 2 • KERAK PUTIH DI DAUN & BAU AMIS PENGUNDANG SEMUT
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-[14px] font-bold text-white leading-tight">
                Pupuk Bubuk Bikin Daun Bercak Kapur & POC Ikan Bau Bangkai di Teras Rumah!
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="px-3 py-2 text-[12px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
            Residu pupuk bubuk merusak kilap daun koleksi mahal, sedangkan bau amis memancing lalat media & busuk lonyot.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. VISUAL RECOVERY TIMELINE, COMPARISON & COMPETITOR-KILLER MATRIX -->
