              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="px-3 py-2 text-[12px] text-slate-700 leading-snug">
            Ujung akar angin langsung keluar hijau segar dalam 7 hari dan kelopak bunga tebal anti rontok.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div class="relative aspect-[3/2] w-full bg-slate-950">
            <img
              src="/images/landing/serum-tanaman-hias-anggrek-aglonema-saratoga/overclaim-2.webp"
